AND THE RESILIENCE OF OUR
PEOPLE,

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.772
WHICHEVER ONE OF YOU IS NEXT,

00:18:26.972 --> 00:18:29.108
YOU'RE GONNA GET HERE A LOT
FASTER.

00:18:36.715 --> 00:18:37.582
BECAUSE

00:18:38.016 --> 00:18:39.818
IF AUNTIE PEGGY CAN DO IT,

00:18:40.018 --> 00:18:41.086
YOU CAN DO IT TOO.

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:46.792
AND PEOPLE

00:18:49.093 --> 00:18:51.229
PEOPLE WILL UNDERESTIMATE YOU,

00:18:51.329 --> 00:18:52.163
MY GIRL.

00:18:52.263 --> 00:18:54.165
DO NOT LET THEM.

00:18:54.365 --> 00:18:55.700
YOU KNOW WHO YOU ARE,

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:57.268
YOU KNOW WHERE YOU COME FROM,

00:18:57.368 --> 00:18:59.271
AND YOU KNOW WHAT YOU CAN DO.

00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:01.806
THERE IS NO STOPPING YOU FROM
ACHIEVING

00:19:02.006 --> 00:19:02.975
YOUR DREAMS.

00:19:05.477 --> 00:19:07.445
AND THERE IS NO STOPPING

00:19:07.546 --> 00:19:08.546
MINNESOTA

00:19:09.047 --> 00:19:14.219
BECAUSE OUR CAUSE IS RIGHTEOUS
AND OUR PEOPLE WILL NOT BEND.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.387
AND YOU BETTER BELIEVE

00:19:16.487 --> 00:19:20.325
THAT WE ARE GOING TO FIGHT LIKE
HELL FOR OUR STATE AND FOR OUR
COUNTRY.

00:19:25.297 --> 00:19:26.665
AND IT WOULD TAKE ME,

00:19:26.932 --> 00:19:31.703
IT WOULD TAKE ME WEEKS TO THANK
ALL OF THE PEOPLE THAT I NEED TO
THANK.

00:19:32.737 --> 00:19:34.773
BUT I DO WANT TO TAKE A FEW
MOMENTS.

00:19:36.241 --> 00:19:38.343
I WANT TO TAKE A MOMENT TO THANK

00:19:39.044 --> 00:19:42.381
MICHELLE TAFOYA FOR RUNNING A
SPIRITED CAMPAIGN.

00:19:44.949 --> 00:19:45.383
SHE,

00:19:45.483 --> 00:19:45.683
NO,

00:19:45.783 --> 00:19:45.983
NO,

00:19:46.083 --> 00:19:46.284
NO,

00:19:46.384 --> 00:19:46.584
NO,

00:19:46.684 --> 00:19:46.718
NO.

00:19:49.654 --> 00:19:51.456
SHE CALLED EARLIER TONIGHT

00:19:51.556 --> 00:19:52.357
AND SHE SAID,

00:19:52.457 --> 00:19:54.659
I HOPE YOU DO RIGHT BY
MINNESOTA,

00:19:54.892 --> 00:19:55.827
AND I SAID,

00:19:56.194 --> 00:19:57.129
YOU BET.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.335
I WANT TO THANK MY CAMPAIGN
TEAM.

00:20:04.302 --> 00:20:06.972
LED BY A BADASS MINNESOTA.

00:20:07.505 --> 00:20:08.473
FROM NEWALM

00:20:10.675 --> 00:20:13.045
WHO RAN A SMALL BUT MIGHTY TEAM

00:20:13.145 --> 00:20:18.617
THAT HELD 360 EVENTS IN 125
COMMUNITIES.

00:20:22.687 --> 00:20:23.188
AND SHE

00:20:25.257 --> 00:20:30.194
SHE DID IT IN THE FACE OF
UNIMAGINABLE TRAGEDIES

00:20:30.395 --> 00:20:33.765
AND UNPRECEDENTED MONEY SPENT
AGAINST US.

00:20:34.533 --> 00:20:35.233
THANK YOU,

00:20:35.467 --> 00:20:36.635
PEYTON LEWIS.

00:20:40.571 --> 00:20:44.409
AND THANK YOU TO THE CAMPAIGN
TEAM THAT YOU LED TO VICTORY.

00:20:44.676 --> 00:20:45.043
YOU

00:20:45.343 --> 00:20:46.211
SLAYED.

00:20:50.949 --> 00:20:52.551
AND TO MEGAN SHANNON.

00:20:56.721 --> 00:20:58.756
OUR DEPUTY CAMPAIGN MANAGER,

00:20:59.324 --> 00:21:03.194
WHOSE PROBLEM SOLVING ABILITIES
KNOW NO BOUNDS

00:21:03.294 --> 00:21:09.868
AND CAN ALWAYS SOLVE PROBLEMS
AND KNOWS WHICH DIRECTION FLAGS
SHOULD FACE.

00:21:12.336 --> 00:21:13.972
I THANK YOU SO MUCH

00:21:14.539 --> 00:21:15.540
AND TO NOODLE,

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.175
WE CAN'T WAIT TO MEET YOU.

00:21:21.246 --> 00:21:26.752
AND TO EVERY SINGLE VOLUNTEER
WHOSE HARD WORK POWERED THIS
ENTIRE CAMPAIGN.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.387
THANK YOU,

00:21:29.488 --> 00:21:30.254
THANK YOU,

00:21:30.355 --> 00:21:30.956
THANK YOU.

00:21:34.192 --> 00:21:34.992
AND THANK YOU,

00:21:35.092 --> 00:21:36.361
SENATOR TINA SMITH.

00:21:46.905 --> 00:21:48.974
THANK YOU FOR BEING A MENTOR

00:21:49.241 --> 00:21:50.309
AND A FRIEND.

00:21:51.008 --> 00:21:52.410
AND AN INSPIRATION.

00:21:52.844 --> 00:21:55.780
THANK YOU FOR EVERYTHING YOU'VE
DONE FOR ME

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:57.616
AND FOR THE PEOPLE OF MINNESOTA.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.857
YOU ARE LEAVING SOME AWFULLY BIG
CHUCK TAYLOR'S TO FILL,

00:22:05.957 --> 00:22:06.458
SISTER.

00:22:07.391 --> 00:22:08.527
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH.

00:22:10.295 --> 00:22:12.464
AND THANK YOU TO GOVERNOR TIM
WALSH.

00:22:17.034 --> 00:22:19.203
I AM GRATEFUL FOR ALL OF THE
WORK THAT

00:22:19.303 --> 00:22:23.108
WE DID TOGETHER ON BEHALF OF
MINNESOTA'S CHILDREN AND
FAMILIES

00:22:23.441 --> 00:22:27.178
AND THE HISTORIC WORK TO
STRENGTHEN TRIBAL-STATE
RELATIONS.

00:22:27.512 --> 00:22:27.845
THANK YOU,

00:22:27.946 --> 00:22:28.579
GOVERNOR,

00:22:28.679 --> 00:22:30.182
FOR YOUR SERVICE TO MINNESOTA.

00:22:34.185 --> 00:22:36.988
AND LAST BUT NEVER EVER LEAST.

00:22:38.122 --> 00:22:39.291
TOM AND SIOBHAN.

00:22:44.562 --> 00:22:46.131
YOU ARE MY INSPIRATION.

00:22:47.431 --> 00:22:47.866
TOM,

00:22:47.966 --> 00:22:48.900
YOU ARE MY PERSON.

00:22:51.402 --> 00:22:55.073
AND I CANNOT BELIEVE I GOT TO
MARRY MY LOCAL CELEBRITY CRUSH.

00:22:58.376 --> 00:22:59.878
AND THEN EVERY DAY

00:22:59.978 --> 00:23:03.414
YOU DEFINE WHAT IT MEANS TO BE
IN A TRUE PARTNERSHIP.

00:23:03.681 --> 00:23:04.316
I LOVE YOU.

00:23:11.623 --> 00:23:12.924
AND TO MY WHOLE HEART,

00:23:13.124 --> 00:23:13.658
SIOBHAN.

00:23:18.196 --> 00:23:18.930
MY GIRL

00:23:21.065 --> 00:23:24.302
I AM SO PROUD OF YOU EVERY
SINGLE DAY

00:23:24.602 --> 00:23:25.904
YOU KNOW WHO YOU ARE.

00:23:27.372 --> 00:23:28.173
YOUR TALENT,

00:23:28.273 --> 00:23:29.107
YOUR HEART,

00:23:29.207 --> 00:23:29.874
YOUR COURAGE,

00:23:29.974 --> 00:23:30.976
YOUR COMPASSION.

00:23:32.243 --> 00:23:34.012
YOUR HUMOR KNOWS NO BOUNDS.

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.582
AND MY PROUDEST ACCOMPLISHMENT

00:23:37.682 --> 00:23:38.383
EVER

00:23:39.417 --> 00:23:41.619
WAS BRINGING YOU INTO THE WORLD
AND BEING YOUR MOM.

00:23:41.719 --> 00:23:42.787
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH,

00:23:42.887 --> 00:23:43.422
MY GIRL.

00:23:51.296 --> 00:23:52.297
AND TONIGHT,

00:23:52.597 --> 00:23:55.467
IT'S HARD NOT TO THINK ABOUT MY
POLITICAL HERO,

00:23:56.133 --> 00:23:56.935
PAUL WALLSTONE.

00:24:01.973 --> 00:24:04.609
PAUL'S LAST CAMPAIGN WAS MY
FIRST,

00:24:05.176 --> 00:24:06.878
AND HE USED TO ALWAYS SAY,

00:24:07.245 --> 00:24:09.747
I DON'T REPRESENT THE BIG OIL
COMPANIES.

00:24:09.847 --> 00:24:12.016
I DON'T REPRESENT THE BIG
PHARMACEUTICAL

00:24:12.117 --> 00:24:13.151
COMPANIES.

00:24:13.518 --> 00:24:16.454
I DON'T REPRESENT THE ENRONS OF
THE WORLD.

00:24:16.754 --> 00:24:17.622
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:24:17.955 --> 00:24:21.025
THEY ALREADY HAVE GREAT
REPRESENTATION IN WASHINGTON.

00:24:21.325 --> 00:24:23.595
IT'S THE REST OF THE PEOPLE THAT
NEED IT.

00:24:23.695 --> 00:24:26.498
I REPRESENT THE PEOPLE OF
MINNESOTA.

00:24:29.534 --> 00:24:30.368
AND SO

00:24:31.303 --> 00:24:33.638
I WILL SAY IT THE WAY THAT PAUL
DID.

00:24:33.971 --> 00:24:38.343
YOU WILL ALWAYS KNOW WHERE I
STAND AND WHO I STAND UP FOR.

00:24:40.845 --> 00:24:43.147
WON'T REPRESENT THE
BILLIONAIRES.

00:24:43.781 --> 00:24:48.086
I WON'T REPRESENT THE BIG DRUG
COMPANIES OR THE BIG INSURANCE
COMPANIES,

00:24:48.520 --> 00:24:52.057
AND I SURE AS HELL WON'T
REPRESENT DONALD TRUMP.

00:24:56.261 --> 00:24:57.361
I WILL

00:24:57.695 --> 00:25:01.199
REPRESENT THE PEOPLE OF
MINNESOTA WHETHER YOU VOTED FOR
ME OR NOT.

00:25:05.470 --> 00:25:06.304
BECAUSE

00:25:06.671 --> 00:25:08.139
I HAVE NEVER

00:25:08.406 --> 00:25:09.640
BEEN MORE PROUD

00:25:09.840 --> 00:25:11.041
TO BE A MINNESOTAN

00:25:11.142 --> 00:25:12.009
THAN I AM

00:25:12.276 --> 00:25:13.712
RIGHT THIS MINUTE.

00:25:21.686 --> 00:25:22.653
AND FRIENDS,

00:25:23.054 --> 00:25:24.589
WHEN I GET TO WASHINGTON.

00:25:26.224 --> 00:25:28.092
I KNOW I'M NOT GOING ALONE.

00:25:28.292 --> 00:25:30.462
I AM BRINGING ALL OF YOU WITH
ME.

00:25:35.933 --> 00:25:37.802
THANK YOU ALL SO

00:25:37.902 --> 00:25:38.603
MUCH,

00:25:39.004 --> 00:25:40.271
GICHI MIGWICH.

00:25:40.471 --> 00:25:41.138
I LOVE YOU,

00:25:41.239 --> 00:25:42.073
MINNESOTA.

